{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get It Up! is a punishing balancing game in the same genre as &quot;Getting Over It&quot;, &quot;Jump King&quot;, and &quot;Pogostuck&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: Go UP while balancing THE STICK and navigating tricky terrain. Don't drop THE STICK. One false move and down you go. Experience new levels of frustration you probably didn't know you were capable of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 2 to \u221e hours of torturous gameplay. Good luck.<br><br><br>-STORY-<br><br>Gao has been tasked with returning the holy artifact to it's pedestal at the top of the world. If he fails, he will be devoured by the Glompf.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627280?t=1773598520","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627280?t=1773598520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627280/a267ec715ebe94b91fb628669fe72352e3a0982c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773598520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627280/a267ec715ebe94b91fb628669fe72352e3a0982c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773598520","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4481260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get It Up! is a punishing balancing game in the same g